    "title": "Cash for Class at Candaigua Bank - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago\nThe newly opened Canandaigua Bank in the DeWitt Wegmans Parking lot invited Jamesville Elementary School, Tecumseh Elementary School and Moses DeWitt Elementary School, along with the district office to take part in Cash for Class. One member of the staff from each of the buildings did a cash grab wind machine for 30 seconds, which resulted in $1,000 to each school’s PTG and J-D’s Education Foundation Students In Need fund for the district office donation. The J-D district received $4,000 total.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
    "summary": "The newly opened Canandaigua Bank in the DeWitt Wegmans Parking lot invited Jamesville Elementary School, Tecumseh Elementary School and Moses DeWitt Elementary School, along with the district office to take part in Cash for Class. One member of the staff from each of the buildings did a cash grab wind machine for 30 seconds, which resulted in $1,000 to each school’s PTG and J-D’s Education Foundation Students In Need fund for the district office donation. The J-D district received $4,000 total.",
